{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"verifyLogoutToken","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"token","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configuration","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OidcConfiguration","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OidcConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VerifiedLogoutToken","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK19VerifiedLogoutTokenV"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This is the half that carries security weight: the input arrives unsolicited, from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"network, and instructs the RP to terminate a session. Every check below is required, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each exists because skipping it has a name:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Signature against the OP’s JWKS, through the same §12.4 verifier — no second"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key-fetching path."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"iss"},{"type":"text","text":" matches the discovery issuer; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"aud"},{"type":"text","text":" contains this client’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"client_id"},{"type":"text","text":". A token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"minted for another RP is not accepted here."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"events"},{"type":"text","text":" contains the back-channel logout key with an object value. This is what"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"distinguishes a logout token from an ID token; skipping it accepts a replayed ID token"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as a logout instruction."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nonce"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"absent","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Back-Channel Logout 1.0 §2.4 forbids it, and its presence is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the documented signature of an ID token being replayed — rejected, not ignored."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"At least one of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sid"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sub"},{"text":" is present. A token naming neither identifies nothing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"exp","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is in the future and ","type":"text"},{"code":"iat","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" recent.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken\/sid","isActive":true},{"text":" is present, end that session only.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" Falling back to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“every session for "},{"code":"sub","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"” when a "},{"code":"sid","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" was supplied is the same over-reach the server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses to make."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/VerifiedLogoutToken\/jwtID","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" is surfaced so the caller can deduplicate; this SDK does"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not dedup internally (§12.7.3 rule 7) — delivery is at-least-once, and a library with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"durable store would silently drop a real second logout after a restart."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/verifylogouttoken(_:configuration:)"]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Verify a back-channel logout token the OP POSTed to this relying party’s own endpoint","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(§12.7.3).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"verifyLogoutToken","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"configuration","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV","text":"OidcConfiguration","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK19VerifiedLogoutTokenV","text":"VerifiedLogoutToken","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","externalID":"s:8AxiamS